{"4327060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elzypon", "steam_appid": 4327060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematically centered on <strong>Western Qabalah</strong>, <strong>Elzypon</strong> is a surrealist <strong>turn-based RPG </strong>drenched in myth, symbolism and  and hypnogogic irony</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One first incarnates in the temple of <strong>Malkuth</strong> as a wanderer, a soul given the immense task of large scale amelioration (It's a lot, i know). You must climb the tree of life, facing the trials and tribulations presented to you in each sphere in the form of archetypal vices and thoughtforms wishing to inhabit your psyche. It's requisite that one truly knows themselves if they're ever to bridge the light down from <strong>Kether</strong> and into <strong>Malkuth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate Qabalistic correspondence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hub-and-spoke world design with 10+ areas to lose yourself in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophy delivered through ironic dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Mystery School</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized first-person turn based combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique Enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 elemental attack types with 40+ attacks and differing playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archetypal Symbolism presented by strange inhabitants and the quests they give you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hypnotic and immersive OST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NG+ capabilities </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematically centered on <strong>Western Qabalah</strong>, <strong>Elzypon</strong> is a surrealist <strong>turn-based RPG </strong>drenched in myth, symbolism and  and hypnogogic irony</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One first incarnates in the temple of <strong>Malkuth</strong> as a wanderer, a soul given the immense task of large scale amelioration (It's a lot, i know). You must climb the tree of life, facing the trials and tribulations presented to you in each sphere in the form of archetypal vices and thoughtforms wishing to inhabit your psyche. It's requisite that one truly knows themselves if they're ever to bridge the light down from <strong>Kether</strong> and into <strong>Malkuth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate Qabalistic correspondence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hub-and-spoke world design with 10+ areas to lose yourself in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophy delivered through ironic dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Mystery School</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized first-person turn based combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique Enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 elemental attack types with 40+ attacks and differing playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archetypal Symbolism presented by strange inhabitants and the quests they give you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hypnotic and immersive OST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NG+ capabilities </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Elyzpon is metaphysical pedagogy disguised as a turn-based JRPG.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327060/8b0a8283960bb5d0149391aecc1495814b88b223/header.jpg?t=17882